### Libra API - requests for VS Code "REST Client" / JetBrains HTTP Client
@base = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Create member
POST {{base}}/api/v1/members
Content-Type: application/json

{"full_name": "Lesya Ukrainka", "email": "lesya@example.com", "password": "lisova_pisnia", "max_active_loans": 3}

### Create book
POST {{base}}/api/v1/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"isbn": "978-1-4493-7332-0", "title": "Designing Data-Intensive Applications", "author": "Martin Kleppmann", "published_year": 2017, "total_copies": 2}

### List / search books
GET {{base}}/api/v1/books?q=data&available_only=true&limit=10&offset=0

### Get book
GET {{base}}/api/v1/books/1

### Update book
PATCH {{base}}/api/v1/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"total_copies": 3}

### Login -> copy access_token into @token below
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "lesya@example.com", "password": "lisova_pisnia"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Who am I
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Borrow a book
POST {{base}}/api/v1/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"book_id": 1, "days": 14}

### My active loans
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me/loans?active=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Return a book
POST {{base}}/api/v1/loans/1/return
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### High-load report
GET {{base}}/api/v1/reports/popular-books?days=30&limit=10

### Member loans (admin view)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/members/1/loans
